    <div class="arrow-down">&#9660;</div>
    <div class="step-box">5. Design board: place parts &amp; wiring</div>
    <div class="arrow-down">&#9660;</div>
    <div class="step-box">6. Setup/run design rule check (DRC)</div>
    <div class="arrow-down">&#9660;</div>
    <div class="step-box">7. Do 3D rendering</div>
    <div class="arrow-down">&#9660;</div>
